---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { business, img } from "../data/business";
import { locations } from "../data/locations";
import ContactForm from "../components/ContactForm.astro";
import StatsBar from "../components/StatsBar.astro";
import NextPage from "../components/NextPage.astro";

const heroPublicId = "roof-repairs-croydon/site/london-residential-street-parked-cars-croydon";
const heroImg = img(heroPublicId, 1200);

const breadcrumbSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  itemListElement: [
    { "@type": "ListItem", position: 1, name: "Home", item: business.url },
    { "@type": "ListItem", position: 2, name: "Contact", item: `${business.url}/contact` },
  ],
};

const days = `${business.openingHours.days[0]} to ${business.openingHours.days[business.openingHours.days.length - 1]}`;
---

<Layout
  title="Contact Roof Repairs Croydon | Free Roof Survey"
  description="Contact Roof Repairs Croydon for a free roof survey and a fixed written quote. Call 020 4538 1998 or send a message. No call-out fee, anywhere."
  heroImage={heroImg}
  ogImage={heroImg}
  schema={[breadcrumbSchema]}
>
  <section class="relative bg-ink text-white overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate via-ink to-ink" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 lg:py-16 text-center">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-xs text-steel-light/60">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-brand-light">Home</a>
        <span class="mx-2 text-steel">/</span>
        <span class="text-steel-light">Contact</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight">
        <a href="/" class="text-white hover:text-brand-light transition-colors">Contact Roof Repairs Croydon</a>
      </h1>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-brand-light">
        Ready to have somebody take a proper look?
      </h2>
      <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-semibold text-steel-light">
        Free survey, free written quote, and no charge at all for coming out to tell you it is fine
      </h3>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-steel-light text-left">
        The quickest route is the phone, particularly if water is coming in right now. Otherwise
        fill in the form and somebody will get back to you to arrange a time. It helps enormously
        if you can say which room the problem shows up in and whether it depends on the weather -
        that alone narrows things down before anyone has been anywhere near your roof.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-10 text-left">
        <ContactForm page="Contact page" title="Request a free survey" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <StatsBar />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink rule">How to reach us</h2>
      <dl class="mt-8 space-y-6">
        <div>
          <dt class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate/50">Phone</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-xl font-bold text-ink">
            <a href={business.phoneHref} class="hover:text-brand-dark">{business.phone}</a>
          </dd>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate/70">
            Best for anything urgent. If nobody picks up we are up a ladder, so leave a message
            and you will get a call back.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate/50">Email</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">
            <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`} class="hover:text-brand-dark break-all">{business.email}</a>
          </dd>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate/70">
            Photographs are genuinely useful. One from the ground and one of the damp inside will
            often tell us most of what we need before the visit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate/50">Where we are</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">
            {business.address.street}, {business.address.locality}, {business.address.postcode}
          </dd>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate/70">
            This is a trading address rather than a shop, so please ring rather than turning up.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate/50">Hours</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">
            {days}, {business.openingHours.opens} to {business.openingHours.closes}
          </dd>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate/70">
            Water actively coming into a house is dealt with outside those hours, at no extra
            charge for the timing.
          </p>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink rule">What happens next</h2>
      <ol class="mt-8 space-y-5">
        <li class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="flex-none w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center">1</span>
          <p class="text-slate/80"><span class="font-semibold text-ink">We ring you back</span> and ask a few questions. Some problems are diagnosable over the phone, and occasionally we can tell you it does not need a visit at all.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="flex-none w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center">2</span>
          <p class="text-slate/80"><span class="font-semibold text-ink">Somebody comes out</span> at a time that suits you, goes up, and looks in the loft as well. Half an hour, free, no obligation.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="flex-none w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
          <p class="text-slate/80"><span class="font-semibold text-ink">You get the diagnosis</span> there and then, in plain terms, with photographs of anything that needs seeing.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="flex-none w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center">4</span>
          <p class="text-slate/80"><span class="font-semibold text-ink">A written quote follows</span>, itemised, with access on its own line. Take it elsewhere for comparison if you want to. Nobody will chase you.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <div class="mt-8 rounded-xl border border-slate/15 bg-white p-6">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">Water coming in right now?</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate/80">
          Do not wait for the form. Ring. Move what you can out from under it, put a container
          down, and if a ceiling is bulging keep out from underneath it.
        </p>
        <a href={business.phoneHref} class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-brand px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-brand-light hover:text-ink">
          Call {business.phone}
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white border-y border-slate/10">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-ink">Areas we cover</h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-slate/70 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Croydon, {locations.map((l) => l.name).join(", ")} and the roads between them. If you are
        near the edge of that list, ring and ask rather than assuming.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2">
        <span class="rounded-full bg-ink px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Croydon</span>
        {locations.map((l) => (
          <span class="rounded-full border border-slate/20 bg-paper px-4 py-1.5 text-sm text-slate/80">{l.name}</span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <NextPage current="/contact" />
</Layout>
